== Biome infobox template ==
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext" style="overflow: auto;">
{{biome infobox
|image=

|Background Tile=
|Random Items in Rooms=
|Rooms=
|Sub Biomes=
|Ecosystems=

|Codenames=
|Id=
}}
</syntaxhighlight>

== Biome infobox types and source info (not template) ==
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext" style="overflow: auto;">
{{biome infobox

|Background Tile=tile name
From: Biom.backgroundCellType

|Random Items in Rooms=Random Room Item name
From: Biom.randomObjectInRooms
Note: Make sure Biom.roomSetups has rooms before including this

|Rooms=| sep of list of room name;weight
From: Biom.roomSetups

|Sub Biomes=| sep list of biome names
From: Biom.subBioms
Note: Make sure Biom.SubBiomSetup.threshold < 1

|Ecosystems=| sep list of ecosystem names
From: Biom.ecosystems -> Biom.BiomEcosystem.ecosystem -> Ecosystem.name

|Codenames=| sep list
From: Biom.name

|Id=int
From: Biom.Id
}}
</syntaxhighlight>